    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a 2022 F-150 with a slipping issue in the transmission. I'm seeing some really weird, irregular pressure spikes when I run the diagnostic tool on the hydraulic circuit. Any idea what the most likely causes would be for those kinds of pressure fluctuations?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
